=### 🚨 Vulnerability Report

- **Title:** {{ $json.output.title }}
- **CWE:** {{ $json.output.cwe_id }}
- **CVSS Score:** {{ $json.output.cvss_score }}

---

### 🔍 Related CVEs / Threat Intel References

{{ $json.output.related_cves.map(c => `- **${c.cve_id}** (Confidence: ${c.confidence_score}%)${c.epss_badge || ''}: ${c.context}`).join('\n') }}

---

### 📋 Description

{{ $json.output.description }}

---

### 🛠️ Remediation Steps

{{ $json.output.remediation }}

---
> ⚠️ **Automated AI Triage Warning:** This report, including the CVE correlations, CVSS scoring, and remediation steps, was generated automatically by an AI Agent. While designed to be accurate, AI models can hallucinate or misinterpret context. Please manually verify all findings and recommendations before applying critical changes.

*Reported via:* {{ $('Code').last().json.firma_origen }}
*Ref:* {{ $('Code').last().json.id_gitlab }}

